{
  "about": "Keeper's accounts contract vectors (syncular/README.md, Domains and the map; story 114.2). Every implementation reproduces each entry: roles is vocabulary.json's roles; barrier_reads[] is whether each barrier state admits, a state the contract does not have reading as closed; discovery[] bodies of GET /databases parse, and serialise back to want (an entry field a parser does not know is dropped, an absent optional stays absent, an entry whose kind or files_writes the parser does not know is skipped); discovery_refusals[] do not parse; admin_requests[] parse and serialise back to json exactly; admin_request_refusals[] do not parse and the server answers them with refusal; admin_answers[] and map_views[] parse and serialise back to json exactly; refusals[] is every code the contract adds, with its HTTP status (null: a commit refusal).",
  "roles": ["reader", "editor", "reviewer", "owner"],
  "kinds": ["general", "personal", "group"],
  "files_writes": ["shadow", "open"],
  "barriers": ["open", "starting", "reconciling", "failed", "stale_restore"],
